  "display_name": "Holmes-Mow",
  "summary": "k(J) = k0 ((J−φs_r)/(1−φ0))^α e^(½M(J²−1)). If J ≤ φs_r FEBio warns and restarts with shorter time step; recommend shorter time steps near pore closure.",
